BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261130-18@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261128T114158Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261130T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261130T210000
SUMMARY:David Finck Quintet
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Acclaimed bassist David Finck brings together an extraordinary 
 
lineup of jazz artists for an evening of world-class music. THE DAVID FINCK
 
 QUINTET features: Joe Locke --- vibes Sam Dillon --- tenor saxophone Tedd 
 
Firth --- piano Dennis Mackrel --- drums David Finck --- bass David Finck i
 
s among the most sought-after musicians in New York. His playing can be hea
 
rd on more than 250 recordings\, including multi-platinum\, Gold and Grammy
 
 Award-winning releases. The bassist of choice for André Previn\, Hank Jon
 
es\, Kenny Rankin\, Steve Kuhn and Slide Hampton\, Finck has also recorded 
 
with George Michael\, Joe Locke\, Rob Mathes\, Tedd Firth\, Philippe Saisse
 
\, Chuck Loeb\, Tony Bennett\, Gladys Knight\, Rod Stewart\, Natalie Cole a
 
nd Rosemary Clooney. In 2008\, he released the highly acclaimed Future Day 
 
(Soundbrush)\, followed by Low Standards (Soundbrush)\, BASSically Jazz (Bu
 
rton Avenue) and BASSic Instinct (Burton Avenue). As a producer\, Finck has
 
 helmed recordings for Tom Wopat\, John Basile\, Carol Fredette\, Melissa E
 
rrico and Christy Baron. His 1991 article for The Village Voice led to a co
 
ntribution to the book Frank Sinatra: The Man\, The Music\, The Legend (Uni
 
versity of Rochester Press). For this special engagement\, Finck surrounds 
 
himself with four exceptional musicians: acclaimed vibraphonist Joe Locke\,
 
 tenor saxophonist Sam Dillon\, pianist and arranger Tedd Firth\, and Gramm
 
y Award-winning drummer Dennis Mackrel. Together\, The David Finck Quintet 
 
promises an evening of sophisticated\, swinging and spontaneous jazz perfor
 
med by five of New York's finest musicians. Tickets & info: https://www.tic
 
ketweb.com/event/david-finck-quintet-birdland-jazz-club-tickets/14282084
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/david-finck-quintet-birdland-jazz-club-
 
tickets/14282084
END:VEVENT
